# The repo is edited from Windows and run under WSL. Without this, a file
# written by a Windows tool gets CRLF, Windows git (autocrlf) calls it clean,
# and WSL git calls the whole file modified -- which tripped the
# "working tree is dirty" guard in run_after_unblind.sh with a diff that was
# 190 insertions and 190 deletions of identical lines.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.parquet binary
